are going to use some of this.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:32.758
And, as you are going to be figuring
out the answers, which will help us to

00:06:32.758 --> 00:06:37.670
together, change lives, change
organizations, and change the world,

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:42.860
